  "verdict": "hCONDEL validation holds with caveats: intersection-70 OR=3.40 (p=0.00068); 510-validated subset OR=3.28 (p=0.00014); hCONDEL-only n=90 test had high power (0.93 at OR=3.19, 80% power already at n~57), so its null is a genuine (mild) attenuation rather than a power artifact; enrichment concentrates in long genes (OR>1 in 2/3 span tertiles, p<0.05 only in T3_long OR=2.06 p=0.012), consistent with +/-50kb length capture amplified by RD genes being long; nc-coupling exists (top-decile OR=2.81) but LOO-nc OR=4.67 (p=1.6e-4) shows enrichment is not driven by the shared phyloP track.",
